  "historyNote": "#7081, eff 8-26-99; ss by #7872, eff 4-14-03; ss by #10004, INTERIM, eff 9-22-11, EXPIRED: 3-20-12 New. #10158, eff 6-27-12, EXPIRED: 6-27-22 New. #13516, eff 3-7-23",
